          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ഉദാരമായ (udāramāya) is built from Sanskrit udāra, \"lofty, noble\" (CDIAL 1935), with the Malayalam adjective ending -ആയ. Being noble came to mean giving freely."
